            Updating any of the following controller properties will cause the associated controller to undergo a restart:


ChassisGuid

Slot

HasPartner




            Note that the IsEnabled property of a controller is akin to turning the controller on (true) or off (false).

            This snippet shows how to use the  method to retrieve the existing
            configuration from a controller, alter a few select attributes, and update the controller.

            var client = ClientFactory.GetServiceApiClientV1("My App Name");
            var chassisGuid = (await client.ListChassis()).First().ChassisGuid;
            var controllerGuid = (await client.ListControllers(chassisGuid)).First().ControllerGuid;
            var controllerData = await client.ReadController(controllerGuid);
            var update = controllerData.ToControllerUpdate();
            update.Description = "New description.";
            update.Slot = update.Slot + 1;
            update.IPConfigurationData = new IP4ConfigurationData {
                Address = IPAddress.Parse("127.0.0.1"),
                Netmask = IPAddress.Parse("255.255.255.0")
            };
            update.ProjectPath = "C:\\users\\username\\projects\\project.ACD";
            await client.UpdateController(update);

