Logix Designer is required to be installed on the server to enable downloading projects to a controller.
This snippet shows how to use the  method to check whether or not Logix Designer is installed on the server.

var client = ClientFactory.GetServiceApiClientV2("My App Name");
bool isLogixDesignerInstalled = await client.IsLogixDesignerInstalled();

